			<div class="content" id="post-content-4860572">
									

<p>Finally, I can actually critique this.</p>
<p>So, I’m not seeing any major problems. Though I do have a few questions. What does child services have to do with this? This seems more like an SCP that would be more useful for elderly people or someone else who wants to remember something from their life. Usually dealing with children is more about forming new memories than calling back old ones. Also, about the obsession that it places on people. Is it more like a violent obsession, an addiction, or a longing? Because violent obsessions are done to death and personally, I feel a sense of longing for the chimes would go best for the theme you’re trying to set here.</p>
<p>Overall though, I like your SCP. You clearly have thought out what you want it to do and I like the versatility in it’s abilities. From a parent flatlining to the subject themself singing the song the testing logs seem interesting. I’d be interested in reading your draft, if you could PM me the link that’d be great.</p>

							</div>

								
					
